<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>A-CODEAI | Enterprise 90-Day Pilot</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Enterprise 90-day paid pilot for treasury and risk teams. Fixed KPI gates, protected IP, and production-ready operating rhythm." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://a-codeai.com/pilot/" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://a-codeai.com/pilot/" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ko" href="https://a-codeai.com/ko/pilot/" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://a-codeai.com/pilot/" />
  <meta property="og:locale" content="en_US" />
  <meta property="og:locale:alternate" content="ko_KR" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #070f22;
      --bg-soft: #0f1c3a;
      --panel: #132448;
      --text: #edf3ff;
      --muted: #a8badf;
      --line: #2a3f6e;
      --brand: #86abff;
      --brand-ink: #0b1738;
      --ok: #86f4cc;
      --warn: #ffd889;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", "Noto Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: radial-gradient(1100px 500px at 85% -10%, #173267 0%, transparent 62%), linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg), #0b1734 56%, #0e1e42);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    a { color: inherit; }
    .container { width: min(1080px, 92vw); margin: 0 auto; }
    .topbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(7, 15, 34, 0.84);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }
    .topbar-inner {
      min-height: 58px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .brand { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
    .lang { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .nav-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; align-items: center; }
    .hero { padding: 72px 0 46px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .badge-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .badge {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(19, 36, 72, 0.55);
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 4.8vw, 58px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .subtitle {
      margin: 0 0 26px;
      max-width: 780px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 44px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--brand); color: var(--brand-ink); }
    .btn-ghost { border-color: var(--line); background: rgba(19, 36, 72, 0.42); }
    section { padding: 42px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: rgba(19, 36, 72, 0.62);
    }
    .label { margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
    .kpi { margin: 0; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; }
    .small { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
    .mono { font-family: Consolas, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #dae6ff; margin: 0; }
    .notice {
      border: 1px dashed var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(16, 28, 58, 0.36);
    }
    .pill { display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 8px; margin-right: 6px; }
    .pill-ok { color: #0f2a1c; background: var(--ok); }
    .pill-warn { color: #2b2006; background: var(--warn); }
    footer { padding: 28px 0 38px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="topbar" aria-label="Top navigation">
    <div class="container topbar-inner">
      <div class="brand">A-CODEAI</div>
      <div class="nav-row">
        <div><a href="/">Home</a> · <strong>Pilot</strong> · <a href="/benchmark">Benchmark</a></div>
        <div class="lang">Language: <strong>EN</strong> | <a href="/ko/pilot">KO</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="badge-row">
        <span class="badge">Enterprise treasury/risk</span>
        <span class="badge">No black-box operations</span>
        <span class="badge">90-day paid pilot</span>
      </div>
      <h1>Contract-grade KPI gates,<br />protected implementation IP.</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        A-CODEAI pilot is designed for production decisions: fixed KPI gates, fixed review rhythm,
        and explicit remediation terms, without exposing proprietary internals.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#contact">Book 20-min call</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:contact@a-codeai.com?subject=%5BCompany%5D%20free%20validation%20pack%20request">Request free validation pack</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/benchmark">View validation policy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Pilot architecture</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card"><p class="label">KPI fixed</p><p class="small">Decision gates are fixed at kickoff and not shifted mid-cycle.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">IP protected</p><p class="small">Internal algorithms stay private; contractual scope focuses on outcomes and operating evidence.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Risk reversal</p><p class="small">Credit/extension clauses are defined upfront for underperformance cases.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>90-day operating cadence</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Week 1</p><p class="small">Scope, thresholds, owners, and rollback policy alignment.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Weeks 2-10</p><p class="small">Weekly brief, event alerts, and miss/false-positive logging.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Weeks 11-12</p><p class="small">Joint audit and renew/expand/stop decision.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Commercial terms</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Monthly fee</p><p class="kpi">KRW 4,900,000</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Event alert</p><p class="kpi">KRW 250,000</p><p class="small">Per alert, capped at KRW 2,000,000/month</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Minimum term</p><p class="kpi">90 days</p><p class="small">Minimum contract value KRW 14,700,000</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Free validation to paid conversion rule</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Free validation</p><p class="small">30 sample validations/month, delayed response, no team workflow features.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Paid conversion</p><p class="small">Upgrade when your team needs production response time, SLA, and contractual protection.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><p class="label">Conversion path</p><p class="small">Request free validation pack -> 20-minute review call -> start 90-day pilot.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Decision checklist</h2>
        <div class="notice"><span class="pill pill-ok">Required</span>Quality gate pass, integrity stability, operating lead-time, and committee fit.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Live status snapshot</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="small">Health API status</p>
          <p id="health-status" class="mono">loading...</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Start with a 20-minute call</h2>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:contact@a-codeai.com?subject=%5BCompany%5D%2090-day%20pilot%20inquiry">Email us</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:contact@a-codeai.com?subject=%5BCompany%5D%20free%20validation%20pack%20request">Request free validation pack</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/">Back to home</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="notice"><span class="pill pill-warn">Legal</span>A-CODEAI is a risk monitoring information service, not investment advisory or trade recommendation.</div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">A-CODEAI · Pilot page (EN)</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    (async function () {
      var el = document.getElementById("health-status");
      if (!el) return;
      try {
        var res = await fetch("/health", { cache: "no-store" });
        var data = await res.json();
        var ts = new Date().toISOString();
        el.textContent = "status=" + (data.status || "unknown") + " (checked " + ts + ")";
      } catch (e) {
        el.textContent = "status=unavailable";
      }
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
